<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="tcards" data-stagger><a class="tcard rv" data-tilt href="/ct-claim-tools/claim-gap-fee-estimator/"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-hands.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-hands-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-hands.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tcard-kind">Calculator</span></span><span class="tcard-b"><h2 class="tcard-h">Claim Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</h2><p>Size the dispute, project an award and subtract flat, percentage or hourly appraisal fees to see your net.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" data-tilt href="/ct-claim-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-laptop.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-laptop-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-laptop.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tcard-kind">Calculator</span></span><span class="tcard-b"><h2 class="tcard-h">RCV vs. ACV Holdback Calculator</h2><p>Split a replacement cost claim into the first ACV check and the depreciation held back, with a repair-by date.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" data-tilt href="/ct-claim-tools/roof-square-pitch-converter/"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-torn-open.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-torn-open-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-torn-open.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tcard-kind">Calculator</span></span><span class="tcard-b"><h2 class="tcard-h">Roof Square &amp; Pitch Converter</h2><p>Turn a footprint into true roof squares by pitch and waste, then compare against the carrier’s square count.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" data-tilt href="/ct-claim-tools/hurricane-deductible-calculator/"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-sky.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-sky-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-sky.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tcard-kind">Calculator</span></span><span class="tcard-b"><h2 class="tcard-h">Hurricane Deductible Calculator</h2><p>Convert a percentage hurricane or windstorm deductible into dollars and see whether the trigger changes it.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" data-tilt href="/ct-claim-tools/claim-calendar-builder/"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="638" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tcard-kind">Planner</span></span><span class="tcard-b"><h2 class="tcard-h">Claim Calendar Builder</h2><p>Build a dated timeline of notice, inventory, proof-of-loss, holdback and suit dates and export it as .ics.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" data-tilt href="/ct-claim-tools/appraisal-readiness-checkup/"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tcard-kind">Checklist</span></span><span class="tcard-b"><h2 class="tcard-h">Appraisal Readiness Checkup</h2><p>Twelve yes/no questions score your claim file and build a to-do list before you demand appraisal.</p></span></a><a class="tcard rv" data-tilt href="/ct-claim-tools/fallen-tree-claim-calculator/"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/fallen-tree.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fallen-tree-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fallen-tree.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tcard-kind">Calculator</span></span><span class="tcard-b"><h2 class="tcard-h">Fallen Tree Claim Calculator</h2><p>Separate tree removal from the house, structure repairs and capped debris removal to see what’s typically paid.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-tint"><div class="wrap split split-top"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Suggested order</p><h2>Using the tools together</h2><ol class="steps-list"><li>Start with the <a href="/ct-claim-tools/claim-calendar-builder/">claim calendar builder</a> so no deadline slips.</li><li>Check roof math with the <a href="/ct-claim-tools/roof-square-pitch-converter/">roof square and pitch converter</a>.</li><li>Had a tree come down? Use the <a href="/ct-claim-tools/fallen-tree-claim-calculator/">fallen tree claim calculator</a>.</li><li>See what you’ll actually receive with the <a href="/ct-claim-tools/hurricane-deductible-calculator/">hurricane deductible</a> and <a href="/ct-claim-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/">holdback</a> calculators.</li><li>Test the dispute with the <a href="/ct-claim-tools/claim-gap-fee-estimator/">claim gap and fee estimator</a>.</li><li>Finish with the <a href="/ct-claim-tools/appraisal-readiness-checkup/">readiness checkup</a>.</li></ol></div><div class="rv"><div class="side-box side-call"><h2 class="side-t">Talk it through first</h2><p>A free, no-pressure conversation. We’ll say plainly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="side-phone" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> +1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-coral btn-block" href="/contact-ct-appraiser/">Send claim details</a></div></div></div></section>
